Source: peritus
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), rustup, pkgconf, python3, ca-certificates
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Corvidae-Coding-Projects/Project-Peritus
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/Corvidae-Coding-Projects/Project-Peritus.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/Corvidae-Coding-Projects/Project-Peritus

Package: peritus
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, git, bubblewrap, dbus-user-session
Recommends: gnome-keyring
Description: local-first evidence-driven coding agent
 Peritus provides a terminal interface, command-line client, supervised
 per-user daemon, and Linux sandbox helper for local coding workflows.
 It runs as the invoking user and does not install a system daemon.
